ion academy e.t spoke with  perry in august just  hours after learning he'd be receiving  the governor's award  for the governors to to even consider me  for it and  to know that they were watching and  paying attention that was really really  powerful and  i i was blown away by it blown away by  it bringing it full circle  the entertainer shared who inspired him  to always give back  where does that come from that pay it  forward attitude  oh that's the dna of my mother you know  my mother was just such a  kind woman i realize that you know  people uh people  aren't are out there uh struggling  because they want to  you know they're people who just need a  hand up and that little bit of  motivation  can take them a long way i'll never  forget being in the grocery store in  winn-dixie  in atlanta trying to uh pay for some  food and couldn't pay for it the woman  behind me  who who gave them me the money to get  the food that i needed  never knew her again but that little act  of kindness felt made me feel like i  could go on so  that's what those moments are about for  me just making people feel like they can  go on
 

